      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> This configuration and\n<a href=\"OAuth2AuthorizationServerJwtAutoConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.security.oauth2.server.authorization.autoconfigure.servlet\"><code>OAuth2AuthorizationServerJwtAutoConfiguration</code></a> work together to ensure that the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/config/ObjectPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.config\"><code>ObjectPostProcessor</code></a> is defined\n<strong>BEFORE</strong> <a href=\"../../../../../autoconfigure/UserDetailsServiceAutoConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.security.autoconfigure\"><code>UserDetailsServiceAutoConfiguration</code></a> so that a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/core/userdetails/UserDetailsService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.core.userdetails\"><code>UserDetailsService</code></a> can be created\nif necessary.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 此配置与<a href=\"OAuth2AuthorizationServerJwtAutoConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.security.oauth2.server.authorization.autoconfigure.servlet\"><code>OAuth2AuthorizationServerJwtAutoConfiguration</code></a>协同工作，以确保在<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/config/ObjectPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.config\"><code>ObjectPostProcessor</code></a>被定义<strong>之前</strong>（即在<a href=\"../../../../../autoconfigure/UserDetailsServiceAutoConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.security.autoconfigure\"><code>UserDetailsServiceAutoConfiguration</code></a>之前）定义，以便在必要时创建<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/core/userdetails/UserDetailsService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.core.userdetails\"><code>UserDetailsService</code></a>。",
